sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Organizer device
    participant P2 as Web scanner
    participant P3 as Events/Invitation API
    participant P4 as Signature validator
    participant P5 as Unique check-in DB
    P1->>P2: Scan QR
    P2->>P3: Resolve event / ceremony
    P3->>P4: Verify signature / owner
    P4->>P5: Insert unique attendance
    P5-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
